{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2021-06-02 16:28:00', 'title': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. ANNOUNCES $500 MILLION PUBLIC OFFERING OF DEPOSITARY SHARES REPRESENTING SERIES G PREFERRED SHARES', 'text': 'PEMBROKE, BERMUDA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. [NASDAQ: ACGL] ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED AN UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF 20,000,000 DEPOSITARY SHARES, EACH OF WHICH REPRESENTS A 1/1,000TH INTEREST IN A 4.550% NON-CUMULATIVE PREFERRED SHARE, SERIES G, OF ACGL (THE “SERIES G PREFERRED SHARES”). THE PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE IS $25 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE FOR AN AGGREGATE PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE OF $500 MILLION. THE COMPANY INTENDS TO USE THE NET PROCEEDS OF THIS OFFERING TO REDEEM'}